        "sid": "JER 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baruku ogosoma egetabu ase Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o kane bw’okogamba kwa Yehoyakimu, mosinto o Yosia, igoro y’Abayuda, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imokia egetabu, orike ime yaye amang’ana onsi nakwanete naye igoro y’Abaisraeli na Abayuda, na igoro y’ebisaku bionsi. Orike kera egento gochakera rituko riria nakwanete naye, ekero Yosia arenge kogamba, goika rituko ria reero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ande nebe ng’a Abayuda mbaigwe amang’ana aria amabe naganirie gokora ase bare, kera omonto nabaise koonchoka atige chinchera chiaye chimbe, na ase ayio, inche nimbaabere ogosaria kwabo na ebibe biabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia akarangeria Baruku, mosinto o Neria, akamoteebia amang’ana onsi ere omonyene atebetigwe n’Omonene, na Baruku akaba okoyarika ase egetabu ekero Yeremia arenge koyakwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia agateebia Baruku iga: “Inche natangirwe tingenda ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aye genda aroro ase rituko ri’okweng’ata osomere abanto amang’ana onsi ay’Omonene korwa ase egetabu eke kwarika ekero narenge koyakwana. Obasomere aase baranyare koigwa buya, obasomere n’Abayuda bonsi abwo barache korwa ase emechie yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ande nebe ng’a abanto abwo nabasabe Omonene na komosorora, na kera oyomo aonchoke atige chinchera chiaye chimbe, ekiagera Omonene okwanire ng’a narente endamwamu yaye enene, na ekeririanda igoro ase abanto aba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Baruku, mosinto o Neria, agakora onsi aya Yeremia konya amochikiire, agasoma korwa ase egetabu amang’ana ’Omonene, agwo ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi o kianda, omwaka o gatano bw’okogamba kwa Yehoyakimu mosinto o Yosia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, abanto bonsi abamenyete Yerusalemu, na bonsi abaruete ase emechie y’Abayuda, bagacha Yerusalemu, bakararia ng’a abanto beng’ate ase obosio bw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agwo ase enyomba y’Omonene, ekero abanto bonsi bategererete, Baruku agasoma amang’ana a Yeremia ariikire ase egetabu eria abwate. Ayio nigo akorete ase eero ya Gema ria, mosinto o Safani omoriki. Eero eria nigo yarenge ase egoora ya rogoro agwo ase egesoero ki’Egeita Ekeyia ki’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egetabu ogosoma ase amasio ’abanene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Mikaya mosinto o Gema ria, omochokoro o Safani, aigwete amang’ana ayio onsi ay’Omonene ariikire ase egetabu eria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agatirimboka gochia ase enyomba y’omorwoti, agasoa ase eero y’omoriki. Aroro agwo nao abanene aba bonsi b’oborwoti barenge baikaransete: Elisama omoriki, na Delaya, mosinto o Semaya, na Elinatani, mosinto bw’Akibori, na Geramia, mosinto o Safani, na Zedekia, mosinto o Hanania, amo nabanene bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaya akabateebia amang’ana onsi aigwete ekero Baruku asomete egetabu eria ase abanto bategererete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanene abwo bonsi bagatoma Yehudi mosinto o Netania, omochokoro o Selemia, omocho kororia o Kusi, korangeria Baruku na komoteebia, “Imokia egetabu eyio gwasoma ase abanto bategererete, ochiche nero.” Ase ayio Baruku, mosinto o Neria, akabogoria egetabu eria, agacha ase bare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakamoteebia, “Ikaransa, otosomere egetabu eyio.” Na Baruku agakora bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero baigwete amang’ana ayio, bakaonchoka bakarigererania bare nobwoba, bagateebia Baruku, “Goika toteebie omorwoti amang’ana aya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakabooria Baruku, “Toteebie, naki gwakorete okarika amang’ana aya onsi? Inee! Nigo kwayarigete ekero Yeremia are koyakwana?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruku akabairaneria, akabateebia, “Ee, ekero Yeremia agendererete gokwana amang’ana aya, inche nario nagendererete koyarika newino ase egetabu eke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanene baria b’oborwoti bakamoteebia, “Aye amo na Yeremia, genda mwebise. Timobaisa komanyia monto onde ase more.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti ogosamba egetabu eria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaanene baria bakaira egetabu eria, bakayebeka ase eero eria y’Elisama omoriki, erio bakagenda ase omorwoti agwo ase egoora, bakamoteebia amang’ana ayio onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agatoma Yehudi agende korenta egetabu eria. Yehudi akayerenta korwa ase eero y’Elisama omoriki, erio akayesomera omorwoti amo nabanene bonsi b’oborwoti bwaye, abwo bamoetanaine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eria ase omotienyi o kianda nigo yarenge ey’etoigo, na omorwoti nigo aikaransete ase enyomba amenyete ekero keria, na omorero nigo ore gwoka ase eriko bosio bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yehudi asomire chinsemo isato, gose inye, chi’amang’ana aria, omorwoti akabogoria omoyio, agachinachana, agachiruta riko ase omorero, chikayia. Omorwoti akagenderera kona‐gokora boigo goika egetabu eria yonsi ekayia ekaera ase omorero oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase abanto aba, omorwoti gose abasomba baye, abwo baigwete amang’ana aria agosomwa, onde tabeete nobwoba, gose tibatandorete chianga chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nekero Elinatani, na Delaya, na Gemaria basororete omorwoti ng’a tabaisa gosamba egetabu eria, tabaigwerete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agachiika Yerameeli, momura oye, na Seraya, mosinto bw’Asirieli, na Selemia, mosinto bw’Abudeeli, ng’a babwate Baruku omoriki amo na Yeremia omobani, korende Omonene konya obabisire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia okorika egetabu ende",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega omorwoti gasambire egetabu eria yabwate amang’ana aya Baruku ariigete ekero Yeremia are koyakwana, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imokia egetabu ende, orike amang’ana aria onsi arenge ase eria entang’ani, eria Yehoyakimu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, asambete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otebie Yehoyakimu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda ng’a aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Aye gwasambire egetabu eke na koboria Yeremia ng’a nase ki ariikire amang’ana imeo ng’a omorwoti o Babiloni nachiche asarie ense eye na gosiria abanto bonsi ne ching’iti chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene agoteeba igoro ya Yehoyakimu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda: Omonto takonyorekana ase ororeria rwaye oragambe ase ekerogo ki’obonene gia Daudi. Omobere o Yehoyakimu okwete notugutwe isiko obe aroro ase omobaso omoororo na ase obokendu bwa botuko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere amo nororeria rwaye na abasomba baye nimbae egesusuro ase engencho y’ebibe biabo. Nindete igoro ase bare, na ase abanto ba Yerusalemu, na Abayuda, amabe onsi aria nakwanete ng’a nimbayarentere, nonya nabo bakaanga koigwera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia akaimokia egetabu ende, akayea Baruku omoriki, mosinto o Neria; nere akarika ase egetabu eyio amang’ana aya Yeremia akwanete. Akarika amang’ana onsi aria arenge ase egetabu eria entang’ani, eria Yehoyakimu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, asambete ase omorero. Boigo amang’ana ande amange buna ayio namentetwe ase egetabu eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
